### 🔐 Login
POST https://api.chatboc.ar/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@demo.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

###

### 🆕 Registro
POST https://api.chatboc.ar/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Marcelo",
  "email": "demo@demo.com",
  "password": "123456",
  "nombre_empresa": "Chatboc",
  "rubro": "Bodega"
}

###

### 👤 Obtener perfil (/me)
GET https://api.chatboc.ar/me
Authorization: Bearer TU_TOKEN_ACA

###

### 📋 Obtener perfil completo (/perfil)
GET https://api.chatboc.ar/perfil
Authorization: Bearer TU_TOKEN_ACA

###

### ✏️ Actualizar perfil
PUT https://api.chatboc.ar/perfil
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer TU_TOKEN_ACA

{
  "nombre_empresa": "Cuatro Fincas Winery",
  "direccion": "Ruta 89, Mendoza",
  "telefono": "2611234567",
  "link_web": "https://cuatrofincas.com",
  "horario": "Lunes a Sábado de 9 a 18",
  "ubicacion": "Tunuyán, Mendoza",
  "logo_url": "https://cuatrofincas.com/logo.png"
}

###

### 💬 Probar el chatbot
POST https://api.chatboc.ar/responder_chatboc
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer TU_TOKEN_ACA

{
  "pregunta": "¿Puedo visitar la bodega?",
  "rubro": "Bodega"
}
